{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 4112U  Eco Animal Health Group PLC  11 September 2026   11 September 2026ECO Animal Health Group plc(“ECO” or the “Company”)Share Awards to Executive DirectorsECO Animal Health Group plc (AIM: EAH), a leading global animal health company developing and marketing branded veterinary prod…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 4112U  Eco Animal Health Group PLC  11 September 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["11 September 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["ECO Animal Health Group plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["(“ECO” or the “Company”)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Share Awards to Executive Directors"]},{"type":"p","children":["ECO Animal Health Group plc (AIM: EAH), a leading global animal health company developing and marketing branded veterinary products to improve livestock productivity and welfare, announces that on 9 September 2026, nominal cost conditional share options were granted under the Company’s Long Term Incentive Plan (“LTIP”) over 404,526 ordinary shares in the Company (representing approximately 0.60 percent of the Company’s issued share capital) to the Executive Directors listed below."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Position"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Number of Share Awards"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["David Hallas"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief Executive Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["232,449"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chris Wilks"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief Financial Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["172,077"]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["These awards under the LTIP are subject to performance conditions being met which have been set by the Company’s Remuneration Committee and relate to Total Shareholder Return (“TSR”) and Research and Development (“R\u0026D”) targets. Subject to the performance conditions being met, awards will vest after the end of a three-year vesting period. Further details on the LTIP can be found in the Company’s 2026 Annual Report which was published on 5 August 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["In addition, on 9 September 2026, nominal cost restricted share units (“RSUs”) over 50,566 ordinary shares in the Company (representing approximately 0.07 percent of the Company’s issued share capital) were granted to the two Executive Directors listed below. The RSUs were granted under the LTIP and will vest after the end of a three-year vesting period but are not subject to performance conditions being met. Further details on the RSUs can be found in the Company’s 2026 Annual Report which was published on 5 August 2026."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Position"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Number of RSUs"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["David Hallas"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief Executive Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["29,056"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chris Wilks"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief Financial Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["2