e":"p","children":["ECO Animal Health (AIM: EAH) is a leading global animal health company, developing and marketing branded veterinary products that optimise livestock wellbeing and productivity."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Group’s proprietary lead product, Aivlosin® is a market leading antibiotic for the treatment of respiratory and intestinal diseases in pigs and poultry, distributed to over 70 markets through an established commercial platform."]},{"type":"p","children":["ECO Animal Health is also investing in the next generation of animal health products through a self-funded R\u0026D pipeline, with a particular focus on prevention and vaccines. The first product from ECO’s pipeline, ECOVAXXIN® MS, a poultry vaccine targeting Mycoplasma synoviae infection, was commercially launched in the EU in July 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["Headquartered in the UK, with a global presence, ECO Animal Health employs over 200 people worldwide."]},{"type":"p","children":["View the Group’s website or LinkedIn page for further information."]},{"type":"p","children":["PDMR Notification - ECO LTIP Nominal Cost Conditional Share Awards"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["1."]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Details of the person discharging managerial responsibilities / person closely associated"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["a."]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["David Hallas"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["2."]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Reas